<title>FRANCE: Technip sets up venture with Niigata.</title>
<headline>Technip sets up venture with Niigata.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Technip said on Friday it was creating a joint engineering venture with Japanese Niigata Engineering.</p>
<p>The new Tokyo-based venture's main activity would be in the domain of hydrocarbons, chemicals, petrochemicals and power plants, the French engineering group said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give financial details</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
